  "releaseNotes": "PluginXray 1.0.0.0 is the first stable release of the XrmToolBox plugin debugger for Dataverse. Debug plugins and custom workflow activities with Visual Studio attached without registering steps first. Build synthesized execution contexts, hydrate from live records, and trigger repeatedly for fast iteration. Includes message and stage aware form shaping for Create, Update, and Delete, typed editors for attributes images shared variables and input parameters, full execution context JSON paste, three execution modes Full real Read-real write-mock and Full mock, Visual Studio attach flow, per-run shadow-copy isolation, symbols loaded status, and detailed run logging. This is a debug harness and not a full sandbox emulator.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "Debug Dataverse plugins in XrmToolBox without registration.",
